// ============================================================
// 03a — Exposure Graph: node types in this tenant
// What:  One sample node per NodeLabel — learn what kinds of
//        entities your exposure graph actually contains before
//        writing targeted queries.
// Table: ExposureGraphNodes — Defender XDR Advanced Hunting
//        (requires Microsoft Security Exposure Management).
// How to test: paste into Advanced Hunting and Run.
//        Expect one row per node type present in the tenant.
// ============================================================
ExposureGraphNodes
| summarize take_any(*) by NodeLabel
